1.	SPDX 3.0.1 Context: Uses official SPDX JSON-LD context for semantic interoperability
2.	Core Profile Compliance: Includes mandatory creationInfo and spdxId fields
3.	Thermal Data Modeling: Implements JEP30-T100B thermal schema with:
o	θJA metrics per JESD51-12
o	2-resistor model per JESD15-1
4.	Supply Chain Tracing: Manufacturer linkage through SPDX relationships
5.	Machine-Readable Units: Strict SI unit formatting as per JEP30-D10 schema
This JSON-LD representation enables automated processing while maintaining human readability through SPDX's structured data approach.
